,"text":"クルージング、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にお出かけしてるみたいで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議な感覚だったな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にクイズ大会したり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の名は希望をいくちゃんのピアノで歌ったりしたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズ大会は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりと中田と同じ班だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初はトップやったんやけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は優勝ならず。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しく班のみんなで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えを予想して楽しかった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいごは記念撮影とかお見送りとかで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと楽しい時間を最後まで過ごせてよかったなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/13/4470277/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎撮影会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、初の撮影会がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポーズは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピースorハートorオリジナルでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナルは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ撮影会あるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方との秘密だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で考えた川後っぽいのにしました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/13/4470277/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方ありがとう♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかこういうの初だから、恥ずかしかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも新鮮で楽しかったよ⁽⁽ଘ( ˊᵕˋ )ଓ⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真大切にしてね...♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎趣味のおはなし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川島小鳥さんの写真展と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みづきまももさん×飯田えりかさんのいずこねこ衣装展へ行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川島小鳥さんの写真は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もともと未来ちゃんの写真を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっかけに知りました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な写真いっぱいでした...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/13/4470277/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いずこねこ衣装展は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いずこねこさん愛なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん行ってきたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みづきさんも飯田さんも在廊していて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの川後さんですか?とお声がけしてくださいました。大好きな方なので凄く嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/13/4470277/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みづきさんが作る衣装も飯田さんが撮る写真も素敵です。まりちゃんの可愛さをより引き出しているお二人。いつかコラボして服作ってもらいたいし作品撮りしてもらいたいなあ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/13/4470277/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/13/4470277/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあ、やっぱりこの真っ白なミニドレスかわいいし水中撮影した作品が素晴らしく好みだった。いずこねこ、まりちゃんが大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レイニーアイロニーの衣装が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"展示されてる方も行かなきゃ、♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るるむうの衣装♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画「世界の終わりのいずこねこ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ももちろん見たよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だめだーいずこねこさんが大好きすぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃんが歌ってる姿みるだけで涙が止まらなかった。1人でないた。はああ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい良い、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてキャストも関わっている方も私得だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなめろちゃんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイク・ファッション・美容に関して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問とかあるのかな～～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえずこの３つについてあれば。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カワゴーゴー(755)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも答えてるけど流れちゃうせいか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ質問が多いこのジャンル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し答えよっかなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん男の人でも気になることあれば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひコメントにかいてね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/13/4470277/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.gi